{"resourceIdentifier":"4781","resourceName":"Guangxi Guigang Food Waste Recycling Project","description":"Guangxi Guigang Food Waste Recycling Project (hereinafter referred to as the project) is located at Northwest of Guigang City's Circular Economy and Environmental Protection Industry Demonstration Base, Guigang City, Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region, P.R China. The project is owned and implemented by Guangxi Guigang Beikong Environmental technology Co., Ltd. The purpose of the project is to treat MSW with anaerobic digesters and utilize recovered biogas for electricity generation. The project activity includes MSW collection, MSW pre-treatment system, anaerobic digester, biogas purification, biogas utilization system and emergency flaring system. The project is to utilize the biogas produced by anaerobic digestion for power generation. The electricity generated by the project is first used for the project and the surplus will be supplied to China South Power Grid (CSPG) which is dominated by coal-fired power stations.","location":{"latitude":23.169150,"longitude":109.735951},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-11-10","endExclusive":"2023-12-11","endInclusive":"2023-12-10"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4781"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangxi Guigang Beikong Environmental technology Co., Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"26194"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM